{"parse":{"title":"个性/静奏杀机","pageid":6507,"revid":14859,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%9D%99%E5%A5%8F%E6%9D%80%E6%9C%BA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%9D%99%E5%A5%8F%E6%9D%80%E6%9C%BA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%9D%99%E5%A5%8F%E6%9D%80%E6%9C%BA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>静奏杀机</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.9D.99.E5.A5.8F.E6.9D.80.E6.9C.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"静奏杀机\"><b>静奏杀机</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 静奏杀机.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/t3at4grcxtqsykko32mjjaf7404yfff.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%9D%99%E5%A5%8F%E6%9D%80%E6%9C%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/t3at4grcxtqsykko32mjjaf7404yfff.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%9D%99%E5%A5%8F%E6%9D%80%E6%9C%BA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/ff/t3at4grcxtqsykko32mjjaf7404yfff.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />静奏杀机\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值、魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">5%</font>。<br />✦使用技能时，暴击率附加到治疗效果上，最多通过此效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>治疗效果。<br />✦行动结束时，若处于任意&#91;维持&#93;状态，则获得1层&#91;<font color=\"#54b4db\">杀机</font>&#93;，并使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有&lt;埃拉曼&gt;阵营的己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层&#91;<font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font>&#93;。<br />✦处于任意&#91;<font color=\"#f3c156\">维持</font>&#93;状态时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦拥有额外技能&#91;<font color=\"#54b4db\">终曲•寒芒出鞘</font>&#93;。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B5%AB%E7%A0%82\" title=\"角色图鉴库/赫砂\"><img alt=\"头像 赫砂.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b2/g4conc6pmbuz5qd71or93lj2adce8ab.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">赫砂</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值、魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。<br />✦使用技能时，暴击率附加到治疗效果上，最多通过此效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>治疗效果。<br />✦行动结束时，若处于任意&#91;维持&#93;状态，则获得1层&#91;<font color=\"#54b4db\">杀机</font>&#93;，并使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有&lt;埃拉曼&gt;阵营的己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层&#91;<font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font>&#93;。<br />✦处于任意&#91;<font color=\"#f3c156\">维持</font>&#93;状态时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦拥有额外技能&#91;<font color=\"#54b4db\">终曲•寒芒出鞘</font>&#93;。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值、魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。<br />✦使用技能时，暴击率附加到治疗效果上，最多通过此效果提高<font color